  "vibe": "A back-room record shop: aubergine-black (#17141a), an orange label (#ff8c42), a hot rose and a teal, with Righteous stamping every title. The backdrop is a working deck — a cream-rimmed platter with three groove rings and an orange centre label, its tonearm line sweeping the record at 2.4 rad/s; a second teal arm sways above it carrying a rose headshell; five sleeve spines fan across the top corner, each bobbing out of time; a three-bar orange equaliser jumps at the left. Statement beats flood full rose over wax; the closing card flips to teal. The camera opens on a spin and stays loose — 1.4° roll with a slight skew. Mechanics: a stacked crate scroll, a crossfader slider, a sleeve-flap morph and dropped want-list alerts. Best for record shops, labels, club nights and bars.",
